text = "[center][font_size=32][color=#E5B842]CAMPAIGN[/color][/font_size]

[font_size=22][color=#E5B842]Coming soon[/color][/font_size][/center]

The campaign is scripted missions — objectives, triggers and a story order to play them in — run on the same hosted match everything else runs on, with the host on loopback and nobody else invited.

Nothing about it is built yet. Until it is, the game is played from [b]MULTIPLAYER[/b] on the main menu, which opens the skirmish and lobby screen: pick a map, set the opponents to PlayTest AI for a game on your own, or set a slot to Open and give somebody your address for a game against a person.

[color=#E5B842]Tracked as PLAN.md 12.3.[/color]"
